    <briefdescription>
<para>Description of the location of a variable whose Address is valid and unchanging during function execution. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The Address may be:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>A stack index, which can be negative for fixed stack objects.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>A <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_m_c_register" kindref="compound">MCRegister</ref>, whose entry value contains the address of the variable. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
